<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Daelim Industrial H1 net profit up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Daelim Industrial H1 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	 (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				 231    vs   216</p>
<p>    Net profit				  8.24 vs     7.44</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			12.25 vs    11.13</p>
<p>    Turnover				1,315.97 vs 1,132.12</p>
<p>Note - Daelim Industrial Co Ltd is South Korea's leading construction and petrochemical company. The Korea Listed Companies Association provided the figures but no further details.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
